<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 23:50:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</link><description>在该国最著名的银行家之一被任命为新财政部长后，巴西资产上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister'&gt;卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil’s Real Caps Best Week Since 2020 as Trabuco Lifts Mood&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:08:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>标准普尔就预算和欧元雄心上调匈牙利信贷前景</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hungary-credit-outlook-lifted-by-s-p-on-budget-and-euro-ambition</link><description>标准普尔全球评级将匈牙利主权债务前景从负面上调至稳定，理由是总理彼得·马扎尔内阁计划采取措施削减预算赤字并最终采用欧元。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hungary-credit-outlook-lifted-by-s-p-on-budget-and-euro-ambition'&gt;标准普尔就预算和欧元雄心上调匈牙利信贷前景&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Hungary Credit Outlook Lifted by S&amp;P on Budget and Euro Ambition&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/hungary-credit-outlook-lifted-by-s-p-on-budget-and-euro-ambition</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 21:19:31 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</link><description>随着投资者重返科技股以及人工智能行业情绪改善，亚洲新兴市场股市预计每周上涨，收复了近期的部分抛售。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing'&gt;随着市场重新站稳脚跟，亚洲新兴市场股市将每周上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Emerging-Market Stocks Snag Best Week Since June on Tech Rebound&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/em-asia-stocks-set-for-weekly-gain-as-markets-regain-footing</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:33:48 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>为超级富裕家庭管理 300B 美元：霍莉·麦克唐纳 (Holly MacDonald) 的商业硕士</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/masters-in-business-with-holly-macdonald-video</link><description>巴里与贝西默信托公司首席执行官霍莉·麦克唐纳进行了交谈。他们讨论了她在巴西的工作经历，以及投资新兴市场如何塑造她的投资理念。他们还讨论了美元的持久强势，以及 Bessemer 如何从单一家族办公室发展成为一家价值 3000 亿美元的企业。他们还讨论了如何构建世代财富和缓和家庭冲突。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/masters-in-business-with-holly-macdonald-video'&gt;为超级富裕家庭管理 300B 美元：霍莉·麦克唐纳 (Holly MacDonald) 的商业硕士&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Managing $300B for Ultra Wealthy Families: Masters in Business with Holly MacDonald&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/masters-in-business-with-holly-macdonald-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:14:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>被监禁的巴西沙滩足球明星卷入俄美间谍纠纷</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jailed-brazil-beach-soccer-star-drawn-into-russia-us-spy-dispute</link><description>一名巴西沙滩足球明星在莫斯科和华盛顿都在通缉的一名涉嫌俄罗斯间谍的争端中成为了一个不太可能的讨价还价筹码。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jailed-brazil-beach-soccer-star-drawn-into-russia-us-spy-dispute'&gt;被监禁的巴西沙滩足球明星卷入俄美间谍纠纷&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Jailed Brazil Beach Soccer Star Drawn Into Russia-US Spy Dispute&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/jailed-brazil-beach-soccer-star-drawn-into-russia-us-spy-dispute</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 22:29:56 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>